                        "string_id":  "lucky_second_dialog_phrase_2",
                        "occurrence":  1,
                        "EN":  "Thank you very much, it has a lot of valuable information for me. Hope you managed to avenge my mates, those bandits deserved to bite the dust! Now, I\u0027ll get to work on your laptop right away, but it may take a while for the programs to crack the password. In the meantime, why don\u0027t you go to Lukash and ask him about the \"sniper\" situation? I can see you\u0027re a no-nonsense type of guy, and I frankly couldn\u0027t think of a better person for that job. It\u0027ll help kill some time while I crack the laptop.",
                        "JA_current":  "Thank you very much, it has a lot of valuable information for me. Hope you managed to avenge my mates, those bandits deserved to bite the dust! Now, I\u0027ll get to work on your laptop right away, but it may take a while for the programs to crack the password. In the meantime, why don\u0027t you go to Lukash and ask him about the \"sniper\" situation? I can see you\u0027re a no-nonsense type of guy, and I frankly couldn\u0027t think of a better person for that job. It\u0027ll help kill some time while I crack the laptop.",
                        "JA_new":  "本当にありがとう。大事な情報がたくさん入ってるんだ。仲間の仇も取れたといいな。あのバンディットどもには当然の報いだ！ さて、すぐノートパソコンの解析に取りかかるが、プログラムがパスワードを解読するまで少し時間がかかる。その間にルカシュのところへ行って、「狙撃手」の件を聞いてみないか？ あんたは話が早そうだし、この仕事を頼むなら他にいい奴はいない。俺が解析してる間の時間つぶしにもなるだろ。",
                        "review_notes":  null,
